# The three romances and the Tale of Taliesin: guide pages for Owain, Peredur, Geraint and Hanes Taliesin
# (November 2026). Same format as mabinogi_tales.py, which adds TALES here to its own list.
# House rules (EDITORIAL.md): proud and respectful; the Britons and the Cymry, never Celts; Arthur is a king.
# Sources: R. L. Thomson, Owein (1968); Glenys Goetinck, Historia Peredur vab Efrawc (1976); R. L. Thomson,
# Ystorya Gereint uab Erbin (1997); Patrick K. Ford, Ystoria Taliesin (1992); Juliette Wood, "The Elphin section
# of Hanes Taliesin", Études celtiques 1981; Sioned Davies, The Mabinogion (2007).

